that would apply to all of the leaders in

00:02:57.519 --> 00:03:00.319
the party who will be seeking office.

00:03:00.319 --> 00:03:01.739
Speaker 1: There you go.

00:03:01.739 --> 00:03:07.050
So even Mitch McConnell not ruling it out,
the bar is very low.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:10.140
